			"B.Eng (Hons) Civil Engineering, University of Nottingham. The lead architect of Tiong Hock’s expansion. He combines engineering logic with the foresight to drive our multi-branch growth and long-term industry strategy.",
	},
	{
		name: "Vince Chan Chee Hou",
		role: "Technical Director & Systems Architect",
		detail:
			"B.Eng (Hons) Civil Engineering, Curtin University. Lead developer of the Stock Pilot ERP, digitizing the warehouse for the next generation.",
	},
